    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Hi, my friends. My name is Jack. When I was a kid, I lived in an "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "orphanage",
            "zh": "孤儿院"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Taiwan, China. I felt lost and was "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "uncertain",
            "zh": "不确定的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about my future. But I got lucky. A cycling team called “Bike Angel” came into my life and changed it forever."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This team was "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "set up",
            "ref": "v-set-up"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by a social worker, Mr. "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Yang Minzhong",
            "zh": "杨民忠"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In 2011, he visited my orphanage. He learned that many of us liked to ride bikes. But we didn’t have enough money to buy our own bikes. Mr. Yang decided to help us "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "realize",
            "ref": "v-realize"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " our dream of travelling by bicycle."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The following summer, Mr. Yang organized a cycling team of 75 people. Among them were 35 young people, including myself. After biking around the island of Taiwan, we cycled from Beijing to Xiamen. During this 40-day trip, we travelled about 3,200 kilometres. We enjoyed the beautiful "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "scenery",
            "ref": "v-scenery"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of different cities. In Beijing, for example, we stood at the foot of the Great Wall and visited the Bird’s Nest Stadium. We also "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "developed",
            "ref": "v-develop"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " deep friendships with "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "mainland volunteers",
            "zh": "大陆的志愿者"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After this trip, I became a volunteer for the Bike Angel team. Over the past ten years, more than 900 children and young people from Taiwan, China have taken part in our cycling tours. Thanks to these trips, many of them found hope and started working hard to create a better life for themselves."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In the future, we will plan more cycling trips. Our final goal is not just to go sightseeing, but to help young people see the wider world and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "challenge",
            "ref": "v-challenge"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " themselves!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
